1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 36=

4
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,547
(I have borne our ancestors' burden
for 41 years.)

5
00:02:14,548 --> 00:02:15,660
(I took office young, but corrected
my faults, growing more cautious.)

6
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:22,640
My father plans to pass
the throne to Mu Xun?

7
00:02:28,250 --> 00:02:29,850
The Crown Prince was deposed
and confined.

8
00:02:31,570 --> 00:02:34,010
Yet you're the son His Majesty summons
time and again.

9
00:02:34,970 --> 00:02:36,010
Do you think Mu Xun

10
00:02:36,850 --> 00:02:37,410
will let you go

11
00:02:38,810 --> 00:02:40,090
once he takes the throne?

12
00:02:43,010 --> 00:02:43,920
Given the Crown Prince's nature,

13
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,570
even if my father never summoned me,

14
00:02:47,570 --> 00:02:49,160
he'd never let me go.

15
00:02:50,410 --> 00:02:50,720
Your Highness.

16
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,640
His Majesty knows his days are numbered,

17
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:55,480
so he had me draft this edict

18
00:02:55,850 --> 00:02:57,250
and hide it in his chamber.

19
00:02:58,090 --> 00:02:58,920
The moment

20
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,600
His Majesty sends this decree

21
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,410
to the Chancellery,

22
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:04,850
there'll be

23
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:07,810
no turning back.

24
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:11,410
Mr. Liu, please save me.

25
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,440
If I didn't want to help you,

26
00:03:15,090 --> 00:03:17,090
I wouldn't have come today,
Your Highness.

27
00:03:17,570 --> 00:03:17,850
Here.

28
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,200
But

29
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,640
do you really want to
turn things around?

30
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:27,640
More than anything.

31
00:03:28,090 --> 00:03:29,250
I want to live!

32
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,040
Then

33
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,850
you'll have to do something big.

34
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:47,760
Your Highness.

35
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:49,850
May I borrow your writing implements?

36
00:04:05,530 --> 00:04:07,640
Why did His Majesty suddenly summon me?

37
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:09,290
Chancellor Liu,
you'd best ask His Majesty yourself.

38
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:10,850
I'm just a palace eunuch.

39
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:14,690
Summon

40
00:04:15,090 --> 00:04:16,050
the Vice Chief of the Secretariat,

41
00:04:16,250 --> 00:04:16,930
the Chief of the Secretariat,

42
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,280
the Vice Chief of the Chancellery,

43
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,250
the Supervising Secretary,

44
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:20,810
and the Left and Right
Grand Remonstrants

45
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,130
to the palace at once.

46
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:25,250
I have urgent matters
to discuss with you all in private.

47
00:04:25,690 --> 00:04:28,320
No delay. Let no word leak out!

48
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,960
What... what's going on?

49
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:38,570
(Universe in Harmony)
Look.

50
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:39,050
This is...?

51
00:04:45,130 --> 00:04:46,610
His Majesty's condition
has suddenly worsened.

52
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,050
The last edict has been issued.

53
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:48,960
The last edict?

54
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,250
Hear the edict.

55
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,520
Without the Secretariat and Chancellery,

56
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,250
how can this be called an edict?

57
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,080
Exactly.

58
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,050
Does the Princess Regent know?

59
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,280
Where is Chancellor Liu?

60
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,379
- Exactly!
- Right!

61
00:05:00,421 --> 00:05:01,039
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

62
00:05:01,081 --> 00:05:01,819
Where is Chancellor Liu?

63
00:05:01,861 --> 00:05:02,829
We must see Chancellor Liu!

64
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:04,159
- We want to see Chancellor Liu!
- Let us see Chancellor Liu!

65
00:05:04,201 --> 00:05:04,869
Who do you think you are?

66
00:05:04,911 --> 00:05:05,721
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

67
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:06,930
Outrageous!

68
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,400
- Let us see Chancellor Liu!
- We want to see Chancellor Liu!

69
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:11,669
Who do you think you are?

70
00:05:11,710 --> 00:05:12,529
We'll hear what Chancellor Liu says!

71
00:05:12,571 --> 00:05:13,229
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

72
00:05:13,271 --> 00:05:13,799
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

73
00:05:13,841 --> 00:05:14,471
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

74
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,080
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

75
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:36,980
(The empire teeters on the brink.
The Prince of Jin usurps the throne.)

76
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:08,780
(Weizhou, Hanbei Circuit,
Border of Hanbei)

77
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,610
Weizhou is just ahead.

78
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:22,440
Ruozhu,

79
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,810
we can stop in the city for a day

80
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:25,690
to celebrate your birthday.

81
00:07:27,370 --> 00:07:27,840
Dear.

82
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:29,170
Wait.

83
00:07:33,250 --> 00:07:33,730
What's wrong?

84
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:36,200
I'm sure I heard
the evening drum marking the You hour.

85
00:07:37,490 --> 00:07:39,250
Why are the city gates still open?

86
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:41,170
Maybe we're lucky

87
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,490
and can get in to rest today.

88
00:08:04,810 --> 00:08:05,440
Dear.

89
00:08:06,810 --> 00:08:07,370
What's wrong?

90
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:12,760
(Weizhou)
Weizhou has fallen.

91
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:14,690
The longer we keep the news under wraps,

92
00:08:15,250 --> 00:08:16,840
the better our chances.

93
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,170
Now we join forces

94
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:20,080
and march day and night

95
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,520
straight for Sheng'an.

96
00:08:22,170 --> 00:08:22,610
Let's go.

97
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:30,730
Something this big happened in Weizhou.

98
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,450
Why no beacon smoke?

99
00:08:33,250 --> 00:08:34,040
If that's the case,

100
00:08:35,010 --> 00:08:36,400
it may not be
just one prefecture that's fallen.

101
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:38,520
It may be the entire Hanbei Circuit.

102
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,490
We need to get word
to the neighboring prefectures fast.

103
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:43,800
If war breaks out again,

104
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:44,640
Weizhou

105
00:08:45,130 --> 00:08:46,280
and Hanbei Circuit won't be

106
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:47,490
the only places affected.

107
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:49,640
Since they've killed
all the city guards,

108
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:51,760
the beacon tower officers and men

109
00:08:52,730 --> 00:08:53,920
must be dead too.

110
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:56,850
What do we do?

111
00:09:05,210 --> 00:09:06,010
There's a small path here.

112
00:09:06,490 --> 00:09:07,400
We can go around this way

113
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,880
and get there half a day sooner.

114
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,250
Why is there a beacon fire?

115
00:09:13,730 --> 00:09:14,250
(Wang Chengding, Hanbei Military Governor)
Who lit it?

116
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,010
General.

117
00:09:15,330 --> 00:09:16,450
We've wiped out the beacon guards.

118
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:17,610
The wolf dung's been cleared out too.

119
00:09:18,370 --> 00:09:19,330
(Tan Yuanchun, Handong Military Governor)
I'll take some men back to check.

120
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:30,520
We've burned so many books.

121
00:09:31,090 --> 00:09:32,730
Can the people in the neighboring
prefectures see the flames?

122
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:36,560
Bamboo slips are no match
for firewood and wolf dung.

123
00:09:37,090 --> 00:09:38,800
Let's burn more, and faster.

124
00:09:41,210 --> 00:09:42,450
We've carried these all this way.

125
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:43,640
Scroll by scroll.

126
00:09:44,130 --> 00:09:44,760
Box by box.

127
00:09:45,370 --> 00:09:45,970
Today,

128
00:09:46,610 --> 00:09:48,010
they've finally served their purpose.

129
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,970
Books are only things, after all.

130
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:52,640
Once printed, their words will live on
for generations.

131
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,730
We can always collect more later.

132
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:57,779
Hurry! Over here!

133
00:09:57,821 --> 00:09:58,351
- Ruozhu!
- They're here!

134
00:09:58,450 --> 00:09:58,739
This way!

135
00:09:58,781 --> 00:09:59,151
Hurry!

136
00:10:01,460 --> 00:10:04,110
♪I ride through endless sands
without rest♪

137
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:04,560
Ruozhu.

138
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:06,880
To have known you in this life,

139
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,800
I can die without regret.

140
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,130
We'll walk the road

141
00:10:11,172 --> 00:10:13,490
♪Frost stains my sleeves;
the setting sun lights towers♪

142
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,130
to the underworld together.

143
00:10:16,172 --> 00:10:18,320
♪Wild geese fly south
through late autumn♪

144
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,400
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

145
00:10:21,450 --> 00:10:23,450
I wondered
who had caused all this trouble.

146
00:10:24,090 --> 00:10:25,880
Just two commoners.

147
00:10:26,490 --> 00:10:27,610
Not afraid to die, are you?

148
00:10:27,652 --> 00:10:30,960
♪Let the storms sweep the hills bare;
still, I cling to dreams of home♪

149
00:10:31,010 --> 00:10:31,610
We dared to

150
00:10:31,890 --> 00:10:33,710
♪If one day my homeland calls,
my heart stays true♪

151
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,330
light the beacon fire here today

152
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,280
knowing you'd find us,

153
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:41,370
and knowing we'd die here!

154
00:10:41,412 --> 00:10:45,060
♪Whose eyes have seen the smoke of war?♪

155
00:10:45,110 --> 00:10:47,400
♪I'll ride into battle♪

156
00:10:47,450 --> 00:10:47,880
Lin Dao.

157
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:49,490
Lin Dao?

158
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,010
Lin Dao!

159
00:10:51,052 --> 00:10:52,450
♪Blood stains my sleeves as
I stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

160
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:54,880
Lin Dao.

161
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:56,370
Lin Dao.

162
00:10:56,412 --> 00:10:57,260
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

163
00:10:57,320 --> 00:11:00,250
♪May you live a life free of sorrow♪

164
00:11:01,610 --> 00:11:02,610
What are you waiting for?

165
00:11:02,652 --> 00:11:03,960
♪May the moon shine on us forever♪

166
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:05,450
Kill me already!

167
00:11:09,130 --> 00:11:10,280
You're...?

168
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,730
Chancellor Liu once did me a favor.

169
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:18,850
I won't kill you.

170
00:11:19,090 --> 00:11:20,450
I know your voice.

171
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,730
Tan Yuanchun.

172
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:28,280
Why put on this show of compassion?

173
00:11:30,970 --> 00:11:31,680
Leave a squad behind.

174
00:11:32,450 --> 00:11:33,520
Put out that beacon fire at once.

175
00:11:39,610 --> 00:11:40,250
Lin Dao.

176
00:11:42,420 --> 00:11:47,058
(County Office)

177
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:51,790
(County Office)

178
00:11:51,850 --> 00:11:52,730
Yang Si is ridiculous.

179
00:11:55,210 --> 00:11:56,400
Still drinking and not back yet.

180
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,210
Does he not want to go back to Sheng'an?

181
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,210
Yan Shang.

182
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:07,040
Look north.

183
00:12:08,970 --> 00:12:09,560
What's that?

184
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:14,680
A beacon fire.

185
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:16,250
Coming from Hanbei Circuit.

186
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:21,210
How many men do you have?

187
00:12:21,730 --> 00:12:22,680
We need to find Yang Si fast.

188
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,040
If he comes back to your place...

189
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:28,800
No.

190
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,130
He didn't lose track of time.

191
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:34,040
He left on purpose.

192
00:12:35,610 --> 00:12:36,640
So that beacon fire

193
00:12:37,210 --> 00:12:38,210
has to do with the deposed Crown Prince?

194
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:40,760
I have to get back to Sheng'an at once.

195
00:12:41,090 --> 00:12:41,450
Wait.

196
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,680
If Yang Si is compromised,

197
00:12:50,090 --> 00:12:52,250
then the attendants you brought
can't be trusted either.

198
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,970
Should I report this
to the prefecture first?

199
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:56,160
Our Military Governor

200
00:12:56,450 --> 00:12:58,640
may be able to
hold off Hanbei Circuit for a while.

201
00:12:59,520 --> 00:12:59,850
No.

202
00:13:01,450 --> 00:13:03,040
I knew the generals of both circuits.

203
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,330
The Military Governor of Hannan Circuit

204
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,090
has always been closely allied
with Hanbei.

205
00:13:08,010 --> 00:13:09,280
If Wang Chengding of Hanbei rebels,

206
00:13:09,730 --> 00:13:10,880
it'll be a blessing if Hannan

207
00:13:11,250 --> 00:13:12,010
doesn't join him.

208
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,130
Yan Shang.

209
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:17,250
We must hurry.

210
00:13:37,210 --> 00:13:37,680
Lin Dao.

211
00:13:39,210 --> 00:13:39,760
Lin Dao.

212
00:13:45,210 --> 00:13:47,160
You scared me to death.

213
00:13:49,850 --> 00:13:50,880
Sorry to worry you.

214
00:14:13,100 --> 00:14:15,740
(Ancient Chu Musical Scores)

215
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:19,560
Why do you carry bamboo slips with you?

216
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:23,210
They took the brunt
of the arrow for you.

217
00:14:26,850 --> 00:14:28,040
Ancient Chu Musical Scores.

218
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:30,040
I was going to

219
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,730
surprise you with them.

220
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:33,970
Tomorrow

221
00:14:35,370 --> 00:14:36,490
is your birthday.

222
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:46,560
All right.

223
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:21,400
Who goes there?

224
00:15:39,370 --> 00:15:40,090
Wait for me.

225
00:15:41,730 --> 00:15:42,349
Don't run.

226
00:15:42,391 --> 00:15:43,511
Get home quick.

227
00:15:43,610 --> 00:15:44,370
Slow down.

228
00:15:45,490 --> 00:15:46,899
Come take a look!

229
00:15:46,941 --> 00:15:48,941
Hot steamed buns.

230
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:52,010
Fresh out of the steamer.

231
00:15:53,370 --> 00:15:54,490
Come take a look!

232
00:15:55,730 --> 00:15:56,560
What would you like?

233
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,160
Come take a look.

234
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:02,130
Take care.

235
00:16:02,330 --> 00:16:03,010
Greens.

236
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,160
Fresh greens.

237
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:15,970
(Wang's Tea Shop, Plain Silk Shop)
Very fresh!

238
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:42,760
Why were you following me?

239
00:16:43,450 --> 00:16:46,210
Someone important sent me
to deliver this to you.

240
00:17:13,490 --> 00:17:14,450
(The empire is on the brink.)

241
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:17,450
(I've secretly summoned
Tan Yuanchun of Handong Circuit)

242
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:19,560
(and Wang Chengding of Hanbei Circuit)

243
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:20,930
(to rise and support me.)

244
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:23,120
(When you see this letter,)

245
00:17:24,650 --> 00:17:26,840
(if you still remember the years
we rode side by side)

246
00:17:27,890 --> 00:17:29,600
(and pity my desperate plight,)

247
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:31,800
(go to Hanbei at once)

248
00:17:33,040 --> 00:17:34,490
(to meet Tan and Wang's cavalry)

249
00:17:35,010 --> 00:17:36,040
(and march west toward Sheng'an.)

250
00:17:37,650 --> 00:17:38,520
(If it's too hard for you,)

251
00:17:38,890 --> 00:17:39,730
(then forget it.)

252
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:42,010
(I won't blame you.)

253
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:43,690
(Two beacon fires)

254
00:17:44,650 --> 00:17:45,650
(will soon be lit.)

255
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,360
(You must leave
that dangerous place at once.)

256
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,120
(Fate closes in.)

257
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:52,210
(I)

258
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,690
(have no other way.)

259
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:57,690
(And I must act on my own.)

260
00:17:59,410 --> 00:18:00,410
(The jade pendant enclosed)

261
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,010
(is the one I wore when we hunted
together at the Shangsi Festival.)

262
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:04,760
(It stands in my stead.)

263
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,410
(Please take care.)

264
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:36,360
The jade pendant here

265
00:18:36,970 --> 00:18:37,890
is as good as the Crown Prince himself.

266
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:41,600
Rise, both of you.

267
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:44,800
This pendant is the proof.

268
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:46,800
His Royal Highness has put me in charge
of this campaign

269
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:49,250
and ordered me to meet your troops
and march west toward Sheng'an.

270
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:51,560
It's come to this.

271
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,250
No turning back now.

272
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,490
No room for error.

273
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:56,890
His Royal Highness has entrusted us
with his life.

274
00:18:57,250 --> 00:18:58,170
We'll do our utmost.

275
00:18:58,930 --> 00:18:59,280
Generals,

276
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,600
we are not to lay siege to cities
or engage in battle.

277
00:19:02,650 --> 00:19:04,010
Avoid any obstacles along the way
whenever possible.

278
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,210
Travel light.

279
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,930
Reach Tongguan within ten days.

280
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:10,210
And keep your soldiers in line.

281
00:19:11,970 --> 00:19:12,560
Those who delay will be

282
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:13,650
executed.

283
00:19:14,170 --> 00:19:15,010
Those who leak word will be

284
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:16,120
executed.

285
00:19:16,650 --> 00:19:17,450
Those who shrink back will be

286
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:18,600
executed!

287
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:22,120
Generals, I hope we will work together
with one purpose.

288
00:19:23,450 --> 00:19:23,890
- Yes!
- Yes!

289
00:19:27,410 --> 00:19:28,040
There's one more thing

290
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:30,170
you need to know.

291
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,760
The Princess Regent left the capital
with me in disguise.

292
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,730
She's currently within Lanyang County.

293
00:19:36,250 --> 00:19:37,010
Route the two armies around.

294
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,080
Do not disturb her.

295
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,080
Rest assured.

296
00:19:45,690 --> 00:19:46,970
His Royal Highness knows
this puts you in a hard spot.

297
00:19:47,730 --> 00:19:49,490
Yesterday, he secretly ordered me
to send an elite force

298
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:51,210
to capture

299
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:52,560
Princess Danyang.

300
00:19:53,930 --> 00:19:54,490
What?

301
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:57,890
(Lanyang County Office)
Search everywhere!

302
00:19:58,360 --> 00:19:58,989
Yes, sir!

303
00:19:59,031 --> 00:20:00,749
Search every room thoroughly!

304
00:20:00,791 --> 00:20:01,481
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

305
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:02,730
You guys, over there!

306
00:20:03,410 --> 00:20:04,080
You, go that way!

307
00:20:04,250 --> 00:20:04,600
Yes, sir!

308
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:05,800
Search carefully!

309
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,280
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

310
00:20:08,250 --> 00:20:09,560
Everyone keep your eyes peeled!

311
00:20:09,930 --> 00:20:11,320
Search every corner carefully!

312
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:12,019
Yes, sir!

313
00:20:12,061 --> 00:20:12,781
Search carefully!

314
00:20:13,010 --> 00:20:13,320
Hurry!

315
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:14,760
Nothing, sir.

316
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:15,600
Nothing!

317
00:20:17,890 --> 00:20:19,450
Sir, we've searched everywhere. Nothing.

318
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:22,930
Seal the city gates. No one in or out!

319
00:20:23,450 --> 00:20:24,450
We must find them!

320
00:20:24,840 --> 00:20:25,320
Yes, sir!

321
00:20:25,490 --> 00:20:25,760
Move!

322
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:31,730
(Donglang,)

323
00:20:32,650 --> 00:20:33,250
(after I leave,)

324
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,080
(go take shelter at the charity school)

325
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:36,280
(at once.)

326
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:37,520
Mr. Yan,

327
00:20:38,170 --> 00:20:39,040
please stay safe.

328
00:20:48,730 --> 00:20:49,490
Once we're over this mountain,

329
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:51,410
we'll reach the main road,
and we can ride from there.

330
00:20:52,560 --> 00:20:54,650
How do you know roads like this?

331
00:20:55,010 --> 00:20:55,800
Thanks to you,

332
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:57,760
I've been here for three years.

333
00:20:58,360 --> 00:21:00,320
I know every hill and stream
like the back of my hand.

334
00:21:01,210 --> 00:21:01,690
Almost there.

335
00:21:02,040 --> 00:21:02,840
The trail down is just ahead.

336
00:21:04,450 --> 00:21:05,250
Surround the woods!

337
00:21:05,650 --> 00:21:06,410
Search every inch!

338
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:07,450
Report anything unusual

339
00:21:07,650 --> 00:21:08,250
at once!

340
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:09,170
Yes, sir!

341
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:12,120
They've sealed off the mountain.

342
00:21:13,250 --> 00:21:14,210
My brother

343
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,520
has always been ruthless.

344
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:18,930
Sure enough, he won't let me

345
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,970
make it back to Sheng'an alive.

346
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:00,080
Who's there at this hour?

347
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:01,320
We're just passing through.

348
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:02,650
We need your help.

349
00:22:06,800 --> 00:22:07,410
Sir.

350
00:22:11,730 --> 00:22:12,930
Who are you looking for?

351
00:22:13,650 --> 00:22:15,650
We got lost in the mountains.

352
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,410
We're hoping to stay the night.

353
00:22:22,490 --> 00:22:23,210
Come... come in.

354
00:22:23,730 --> 00:22:24,210
Thank you.

355
00:22:24,320 --> 00:22:24,730
Thank you.

356
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:37,840
Are you two husband and wife?

357
00:22:38,840 --> 00:22:39,189
Yes.

358
00:22:39,231 --> 00:22:39,621
No.

359
00:22:46,490 --> 00:22:47,320
To be honest,

360
00:22:48,170 --> 00:22:49,210
we

361
00:22:49,730 --> 00:22:51,320
are not married yet.

362
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:53,250
But we're already engaged.

363
00:22:55,210 --> 00:22:56,970
My father is a snob.

364
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:57,930
He wants to break it off.

365
00:22:58,760 --> 00:22:59,970
So we ran away.

366
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:02,010
We didn't dare take the official road,

367
00:23:02,410 --> 00:23:03,730
so we tried the mountain paths.

368
00:23:04,690 --> 00:23:05,520
But we got lost.

369
00:23:07,210 --> 00:23:07,730
Sir.

370
00:23:08,250 --> 00:23:09,120
We'll leave at dawn.

371
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:10,410
We won't trouble you.

372
00:23:11,210 --> 00:23:11,760
But

373
00:23:12,280 --> 00:23:13,080
if anyone asks,

374
00:23:13,650 --> 00:23:15,650
please say you never saw us.

375
00:23:15,970 --> 00:23:16,450
Yes.

376
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:17,930
If we're caught,

377
00:23:18,210 --> 00:23:19,360
my father will beat me to death.

378
00:23:20,450 --> 00:23:21,280
Helping someone in need

379
00:23:21,730 --> 00:23:22,930
is a good deed.

380
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:35,730
Please take this money.

381
00:23:36,010 --> 00:23:37,080
For letting us stay the night.

382
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:38,490
Put it away.

383
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:39,690
We can't take this.

384
00:23:39,890 --> 00:23:40,760
We can't.

385
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:42,560
Alright. Have a seat.

386
00:23:42,800 --> 00:23:43,280
Come on, sit.

387
00:23:43,970 --> 00:23:44,450
Have a seat.

388
00:23:47,210 --> 00:23:47,490
I...

389
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:48,210
Let's go.

390
00:23:48,450 --> 00:23:49,010
Let's get dinner ready.

391
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,170
- No, I was just...
- Those two kids must be

392
00:23:50,250 --> 00:23:51,360
starving and exhausted.

393
00:23:51,690 --> 00:23:52,490
Let's get dinner ready.

394
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:05,080
You're quite the liar.

395
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:08,890
They've sealed off the mountain.

396
00:24:09,490 --> 00:24:10,170
Now they'll search it.

397
00:24:11,600 --> 00:24:13,690
Who knows how far they'll get tonight?

398
00:24:17,890 --> 00:24:18,650
If we hear anything,

399
00:24:18,930 --> 00:24:19,760
we'll leave at once.

400
00:24:20,210 --> 00:24:21,410
We can't drag them into this.

401
00:24:54,490 --> 00:24:55,280
I'll go get some water.

402
00:24:58,410 --> 00:24:59,080
Doesn't he look like him?

403
00:24:59,450 --> 00:25:00,360
I think so too.

404
00:25:00,490 --> 00:25:01,520
It's definitely him.

405
00:25:02,450 --> 00:25:03,450
I've never mistaken anyone.

406
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:04,890
That is Magistrate Yan.

407
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:06,280
Keep it down.

408
00:25:06,410 --> 00:25:07,360
Don't let them hear you.

409
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:09,600
When we cook porridge for them later,

410
00:25:09,930 --> 00:25:10,360
we'll just...

411
00:25:22,560 --> 00:25:23,360
They've recognized you.

412
00:25:24,010 --> 00:25:24,360
Let's go.

413
00:25:25,120 --> 00:25:25,450
Wait.

414
00:25:26,560 --> 00:25:27,560
This is Lanyang territory.

415
00:25:27,930 --> 00:25:29,170
It's no surprise the locals know me.

416
00:25:29,730 --> 00:25:30,930
Even if they recognize me,

417
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:32,760
that doesn't mean
they'll tell the pursuers.

418
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:34,760
They clearly recognized you,

419
00:25:34,930 --> 00:25:35,730
yet they're still keeping it from you

420
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,080
and plan to tamper with our food.

421
00:25:38,600 --> 00:25:39,520
What do you think they're planning?

422
00:25:41,170 --> 00:25:42,280
Are we really going to stake our lives

423
00:25:42,520 --> 00:25:43,650
on their conscience?

424
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:47,800
Let's go.

425
00:26:15,450 --> 00:26:15,930
Sir.

426
00:26:16,690 --> 00:26:17,170
Eat up.

427
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:22,170
Then get some rest early.

428
00:26:46,520 --> 00:26:47,040
Not poisoned.

429
00:26:53,320 --> 00:26:54,120
Hurry up and eat.

430
00:26:54,560 --> 00:26:56,560
Don't let them see
we're eating something different.

431
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:05,360
Sir.

432
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:06,560
What are you...?

433
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:15,730
To be honest,

434
00:27:16,210 --> 00:27:16,970
that is all the rice

435
00:27:18,250 --> 00:27:19,450
we have left.

436
00:27:20,080 --> 00:27:21,250
Just enough for two bowls of porridge.

437
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:22,890
We're old.

438
00:27:23,520 --> 00:27:24,170
We can't digest that.

439
00:27:24,760 --> 00:27:25,800
This is fine for us.

440
00:27:46,490 --> 00:27:46,760
Here.

441
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,280
You two eat.

442
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:49,690
We made it for you.

443
00:27:50,120 --> 00:27:50,760
We're not hungry.

444
00:27:51,800 --> 00:27:52,560
Have some more.

445
00:27:55,170 --> 00:27:57,170
I've been drinking this wild greens soup
since I was little.

446
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:00,410
I'll try some too.

447
00:28:05,650 --> 00:28:06,760
I can tell this young lady

448
00:28:07,650 --> 00:28:09,080
comes from a wealthy family.

449
00:28:09,520 --> 00:28:10,520
She won't be used to it.

450
00:28:11,040 --> 00:28:11,600
I can handle it.

451
00:28:20,970 --> 00:28:21,520
Sir.

452
00:28:23,170 --> 00:28:24,600
You recognized me,

453
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:26,600
so why didn't you tell us?

454
00:28:27,970 --> 00:28:28,560
Magistrate Yan,

455
00:28:30,040 --> 00:28:30,690
I

456
00:28:31,490 --> 00:28:32,520
may be old,

457
00:28:33,450 --> 00:28:34,930
but I can handle things.

458
00:28:36,690 --> 00:28:39,360
You and this young lady came
into the mountains late at night,

459
00:28:39,930 --> 00:28:41,930
covered in dirt

460
00:28:42,520 --> 00:28:43,490
and in such a hurry.

461
00:28:43,930 --> 00:28:44,490
I figured

462
00:28:44,890 --> 00:28:45,539
you must be

463
00:28:45,581 --> 00:28:47,991
in some trouble
you couldn't tell others about.

464
00:28:48,280 --> 00:28:49,690
I didn't want to pry.

465
00:28:51,450 --> 00:28:51,930
Thank you.

466
00:28:55,080 --> 00:28:55,600
I'm sorry.

467
00:28:59,490 --> 00:29:00,280
I kept things from you too.

468
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:08,280
Magistrate Yan.

469
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:10,970
Let me ask just one thing.

470
00:29:11,890 --> 00:29:13,080
Once you go down this mountain,

471
00:29:13,840 --> 00:29:15,280
you're out of Lanyang County.

472
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:15,890
Are you

473
00:29:17,040 --> 00:29:18,080
really leaving?

474
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:19,360
We're so sorry.

475
00:29:19,890 --> 00:29:20,520
Really.

476
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:22,690
We have nothing to send you off with.

477
00:29:23,450 --> 00:29:24,690
You didn't even have your fill.

478
00:29:25,210 --> 00:29:25,760
We did.

479
00:29:27,250 --> 00:29:27,840
Thank you, ma'am.

480
00:29:28,650 --> 00:29:29,450
Magistrate Yan.

481
00:29:32,250 --> 00:29:33,560
Will you come back?

482
00:29:36,410 --> 00:29:37,730
The crops

483
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:40,730
haven't even ripened yet this year.

484
00:29:43,010 --> 00:29:44,080
Enough.

485
00:29:46,120 --> 00:29:47,800
They must have
something important to do.

486
00:29:58,010 --> 00:29:58,650
This way!

487
00:29:59,250 --> 00:29:59,579
Everyone!

488
00:29:59,621 --> 00:30:00,549
Yes, sir!

489
00:30:00,591 --> 00:30:01,311
Don't let them get away!

490
00:30:01,360 --> 00:30:02,170
Search thoroughly!

491
00:30:04,930 --> 00:30:05,600
Over here!

492
00:30:06,250 --> 00:30:06,690
Coming!

493
00:30:06,970 --> 00:30:07,360
Coming! After them!

494
00:30:07,490 --> 00:30:08,059
They're closing in.

495
00:30:08,101 --> 00:30:08,541
Move it!

496
00:30:08,760 --> 00:30:09,170
Come on.

497
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:10,210
You two, come with me.

498
00:30:10,410 --> 00:30:11,170
Hurry. Quick!

499
00:30:12,840 --> 00:30:13,120
Let's go.

500
00:30:13,210 --> 00:30:13,650
Come on.

501
00:30:13,840 --> 00:30:14,840
Get inside. Quick.

502
00:30:15,010 --> 00:30:15,280
Hurry.

503
00:30:15,730 --> 00:30:17,410
Lie down and pull the covers over you.

504
00:30:17,650 --> 00:30:18,280
Don't make a sound.

505
00:30:18,690 --> 00:30:20,560
Just pretend
you're my son and daughter-in-law.

506
00:30:20,890 --> 00:30:21,840
Stay in bed and keep quiet.

507
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:24,210
Don't make a sound!

508
00:30:33,490 --> 00:30:34,120
Move it!

509
00:30:34,450 --> 00:30:34,930
Keep up!

510
00:30:35,450 --> 00:30:35,760
Hurry!

511
00:30:38,600 --> 00:30:40,250
A young couple in their twenties.

512
00:30:40,930 --> 00:30:41,410
Have you seen them?

513
00:30:41,890 --> 00:30:42,890
N-No, we haven't.

514
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:45,600
We hardly see strangers around here.

515
00:30:45,970 --> 00:30:46,730
Is that so?

516
00:30:48,410 --> 00:30:49,410
We can't drag them into this.

517
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:52,930
Out the window.

518
00:30:54,690 --> 00:30:55,040
- Let's go.
- Move aside!

519
00:31:10,650 --> 00:31:11,410
Who lives in this room?

520
00:31:13,280 --> 00:31:14,730
My son and daughter-in-law.

521
00:31:24,360 --> 00:31:25,280
Your son and daughter-in-law?

522
00:31:26,450 --> 00:31:26,890
Well,

523
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,800
they usually live here.

524
00:31:29,170 --> 00:31:31,040
They went into town to buy goods today.

525
00:31:36,650 --> 00:31:37,080
Yan Shang.

526
00:31:37,410 --> 00:31:38,170
We have to split up.

527
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:40,170
Your Highness, are you worried
they're after you

528
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:41,279
and don't want to drag me down?

529
00:31:41,321 --> 00:31:41,891
What else?

530
00:31:42,210 --> 00:31:43,040
You're a minor official.

531
00:31:43,170 --> 00:31:44,040
Why would they search for you?

532
00:31:44,410 --> 00:31:44,800
Too late.

533
00:31:45,490 --> 00:31:47,170
Didn't you hear them ask
about two people?

534
00:31:47,840 --> 00:31:48,280
You and I

535
00:31:48,890 --> 00:31:49,600
are together.

536
00:31:51,320 --> 00:31:52,840
Someone's over there!
Everyone, follow me!

537
00:31:53,280 --> 00:31:53,930
Everyone, keep up!

538
00:31:54,120 --> 00:31:55,339
Yes, sir!

539
00:31:55,381 --> 00:31:55,951
Keep up!

540
00:31:57,170 --> 00:31:58,360
Hurry! Keep up!

541
00:31:58,450 --> 00:31:58,739
Keep up!

542
00:31:58,781 --> 00:31:59,581
I'm afraid

543
00:32:00,970 --> 00:32:01,970
I can't save you this time.

544
00:32:05,890 --> 00:32:06,890
Who goes there? Stop!

545
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:28,120
Squad Leader.

546
00:32:29,450 --> 00:32:30,010
The portraits are here.

547
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:31,520
Compare their faces.

548
00:33:10,930 --> 00:33:11,650
You live in the mountains?

549
00:33:13,490 --> 00:33:13,930
Yes.

550
00:33:14,650 --> 00:33:15,760
We're mountain folk.

551
00:33:16,210 --> 00:33:17,840
We were slow getting home today,

552
00:33:18,210 --> 00:33:18,909
so it got late.

553
00:33:18,951 --> 00:33:19,621
Nonsense!

554
00:33:20,040 --> 00:33:21,600
Coming home in the dead of night?

555
00:33:26,210 --> 00:33:27,560
Weren't those two old folks just now

556
00:33:28,760 --> 00:33:30,560
waiting for their son
and daughter-in-law to come home?

557
00:33:44,840 --> 00:33:45,890
Quit standing there!

558
00:33:46,210 --> 00:33:47,080
Keep searching!

559
00:33:48,560 --> 00:33:49,799
Then... what about these two...?

560
00:33:49,841 --> 00:33:50,691
Have you finished
searching everywhere else?

561
00:33:57,840 --> 00:33:58,170
Yes, sir.

562
00:33:59,490 --> 00:34:00,080
Keep searching!

563
00:34:01,010 --> 00:34:01,600
Yes, sir!

564
00:34:17,010 --> 00:34:17,640
Aren't you leaving?

565
00:34:18,160 --> 00:34:19,080
Why didn't you expose us?

566
00:34:28,930 --> 00:34:29,850
Forgive my rudeness just now.

567
00:34:30,520 --> 00:34:30,850
Your Highness.

568
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:32,680
You recognize me?

569
00:34:33,520 --> 00:34:34,370
You are the Princess Regent.

570
00:34:39,040 --> 00:34:39,520
Rise.

571
00:34:44,450 --> 00:34:45,370
You have portraits.

572
00:34:45,930 --> 00:34:46,930
Why not compare our faces

573
00:34:47,520 --> 00:34:48,330
and turn us in for the reward?

574
00:34:48,720 --> 00:34:49,600
I know what you look like.

575
00:34:50,810 --> 00:34:51,680
No need for portraits.

576
00:34:54,040 --> 00:34:55,160
We've already searched this area.

577
00:34:55,970 --> 00:34:56,930
You can go down the mountain this way.

578
00:34:57,600 --> 00:34:58,560
You'll avoid the search parties.

579
00:35:01,490 --> 00:35:02,240
Why help us?

580
00:35:02,970 --> 00:35:03,930
Your Highness, you may not know me,

581
00:35:05,200 --> 00:35:06,330
but I could never forget you.

582
00:35:06,770 --> 00:35:07,640
In the 23rd year of Yingxiang,

583
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:09,080
you ordered every military commander

584
00:35:09,810 --> 00:35:10,640
to bring a squad of soldiers

585
00:35:10,970 --> 00:35:12,450
to the capital for the assembly.

586
00:35:13,930 --> 00:35:14,600
I went along too.

587
00:35:15,160 --> 00:35:16,520
That's when I learned
you wanted to ask us

588
00:35:17,930 --> 00:35:19,080
whether back pay had been issued

589
00:35:19,560 --> 00:35:20,600
and whether our families
had been provided for.

590
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:22,200
That's when I learned

591
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:24,770
the order for garrison farming
to support the troops was from you.

592
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:26,890
That year,

593
00:35:28,370 --> 00:35:29,770
I'd actually been ready to desert.

594
00:35:31,560 --> 00:35:33,520
But then our pay suddenly came through.

595
00:35:34,120 --> 00:35:35,200
So my parents didn't starve

596
00:35:36,680 --> 00:35:37,290
and I didn't become a bandit.

597
00:35:38,810 --> 00:35:39,240
Your Highness.

598
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:41,640
We soldiers have only had enough to eat

599
00:35:42,560 --> 00:35:43,450
for the past three years.

600
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:45,290
What's your name?

601
00:35:46,080 --> 00:35:47,290
I'm helping you for my own sake.

602
00:35:51,850 --> 00:35:52,850
I just want to live in peace.

603
00:35:53,810 --> 00:35:54,890
I don't want to be caught up
in another war.

604
00:35:56,810 --> 00:35:58,120
In the armies
across the prefectures and circuits,

605
00:35:59,810 --> 00:36:01,370
there are thousands of
insignificant soldiers

606
00:36:02,890 --> 00:36:03,680
like me.

607
00:36:18,040 --> 00:36:18,370
Let's go.

608
00:36:30,040 --> 00:36:30,410
Halt!

609
00:37:07,010 --> 00:37:07,520
Yang Si

610
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,330
pays his respects to the Crown Prince!

611
00:37:10,970 --> 00:37:13,160
Welcome, Your Royal Highness!

612
00:37:48,520 --> 00:37:49,410
What is troubling you?

613
00:37:52,370 --> 00:37:53,160
At this point,

614
00:37:53,680 --> 00:37:54,370
is there anything

615
00:37:55,120 --> 00:37:56,080
we can't speak openly about?

616
00:37:56,640 --> 00:37:57,600
I'm just thinking

617
00:37:59,330 --> 00:38:01,330
the drought in Hannan and Hanbei

618
00:38:02,290 --> 00:38:03,450
and the other circuits hasn't eased yet.

619
00:38:04,160 --> 00:38:05,040
Raising troops now

620
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:06,240
will throw the realm into chaos.

621
00:38:06,930 --> 00:38:09,010
The court's relief efforts
may not continue.

622
00:38:10,370 --> 00:38:11,120
Far more

623
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:13,120
innocent people may die

624
00:38:13,890 --> 00:38:15,330
from natural disasters

625
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:17,080
than on the battlefield.

626
00:38:17,450 --> 00:38:17,850
That's true.

627
00:38:18,450 --> 00:38:19,240
With natural disasters raging

628
00:38:19,560 --> 00:38:20,330
and public resentment boiling,

629
00:38:21,080 --> 00:38:22,490
the prefectures are already overwhelmed.

630
00:38:23,410 --> 00:38:24,330
This is the best time

631
00:38:25,290 --> 00:38:26,600
for me to raise troops.

632
00:38:26,810 --> 00:38:27,490
Heaven itself

633
00:38:28,490 --> 00:38:29,600
is on my side.

634
00:38:35,640 --> 00:38:36,330
Do you know

635
00:38:37,330 --> 00:38:37,930
where Wanyao is?

636
00:38:40,970 --> 00:38:41,520
I don't.

637
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:48,160
Wanyao may be a woman,

638
00:38:49,600 --> 00:38:50,720
but she's not to be underestimated.

639
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:53,450
With her in the picture,
anything could happen.

640
00:38:54,370 --> 00:38:55,330
Once I capture her,

641
00:38:56,330 --> 00:38:57,600
you can plead for her then.

642
00:38:59,680 --> 00:39:00,010
Alright.

643
00:39:01,370 --> 00:39:02,930
Go bring Wang Chengding
and Tan Yuanchun in.

644
00:39:03,890 --> 00:39:05,040
We need to discuss

645
00:39:05,970 --> 00:39:06,890
our marching strategy.

646
00:39:07,290 --> 00:39:07,810
Your Highness.

647
00:39:08,890 --> 00:39:09,579
Is there

648
00:39:09,621 --> 00:39:10,831
really no other way?

649
00:39:24,080 --> 00:39:24,770
To think

650
00:39:25,450 --> 00:39:26,450
you're still this naive

651
00:39:27,930 --> 00:39:29,370
after all this time.

652
00:39:29,890 --> 00:39:30,450
Your Highness.

653
00:39:31,720 --> 00:39:33,410
Whenever I think of the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

654
00:39:34,330 --> 00:39:35,560
it feels like it happened yesterday.

655
00:39:35,970 --> 00:39:38,080
The realm has only enjoyed
a few years of peace...

656
00:39:38,370 --> 00:39:39,160
Yang Si!

657
00:39:39,810 --> 00:39:41,450
We've already raised troops.

658
00:39:43,370 --> 00:39:44,640
There's no turning back.

659
00:39:46,890 --> 00:39:48,680
If we back down now,

660
00:39:49,010 --> 00:39:50,810
everyone out there dies!

661
00:39:52,850 --> 00:39:54,040
If they don't want to die,

662
00:39:54,450 --> 00:39:55,970
they'll have to kill you and me first!

663
00:39:57,080 --> 00:39:58,930
We have no other choice.

664
00:39:59,520 --> 00:40:00,080
Yang Si,

665
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:01,970
look at me now.

666
00:40:04,970 --> 00:40:06,240
I've been confined for three years.

667
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:08,770
Every day was sheer torture.

668
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:10,810
But I survived.

669
00:40:11,450 --> 00:40:12,560
Because this throne

670
00:40:12,930 --> 00:40:13,640
and this realm

671
00:40:14,240 --> 00:40:16,930
are what I've sacrificed everything

672
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:19,290
and schemed half my life for!

673
00:40:19,770 --> 00:40:21,770
I am Huai's rightful heir.

674
00:40:24,080 --> 00:40:24,970
But now,

675
00:40:25,370 --> 00:40:26,219
the throne is about

676
00:40:26,261 --> 00:40:27,911
to fall to that fool, the Prince of Jin!

677
00:40:28,490 --> 00:40:29,040
Tell me,

678
00:40:30,330 --> 00:40:31,680
how can I accept that?

679
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:40,410
I'm just taking back

680
00:40:41,330 --> 00:40:43,330
what he stole from me.

681
00:40:45,040 --> 00:40:46,200
That's all.

682
00:40:52,240 --> 00:40:52,680
Any

683
00:40:54,770 --> 00:40:55,810
more questions?

684
00:41:16,520 --> 00:41:17,600
When did you learn to ride?

685
00:41:20,450 --> 00:41:22,450
It's been three years.
I had to pick up a few skills.

686
00:41:23,040 --> 00:41:23,810
Lanyang may be small,

687
00:41:24,040 --> 00:41:25,370
but it's still too big
to get around on foot.

688
00:41:26,240 --> 00:41:26,850
Riding a horse

689
00:41:27,370 --> 00:41:28,560
isn't much different
from riding a donkey.

690
00:41:32,080 --> 00:41:32,970
Where are we now?

691
00:41:33,810 --> 00:41:34,850
We've passed Mount Xiao.

692
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:37,010
Another two or three days,
and we'll reach the capital.

693
00:41:39,640 --> 00:41:42,010
Along the way, the prefectures
and counties have been quiet.

694
00:41:42,640 --> 00:41:43,010
Either

695
00:41:43,410 --> 00:41:45,120
we've left the rebels behind,

696
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:46,010
or...

697
00:41:46,640 --> 00:41:47,410
They've turned their coat.

698
00:41:56,330 --> 00:41:57,720
How did he escape?

699
00:41:58,290 --> 00:41:59,200
That's impossible.

700
00:42:00,160 --> 00:42:01,389
He's been locked up for three years.

701
00:42:01,431 --> 00:42:03,581
He's practically lost his mind.

702
00:42:05,160 --> 00:42:06,930
(Universe in Harmony)
Did he grow wings and fly away?

703
00:42:07,680 --> 00:42:09,200
And end up at the Jinwu Guard's camp?

704
00:42:10,560 --> 00:42:12,640
Speak! Cat got your tongue?

705
00:42:14,930 --> 00:42:15,640
Calm down, Your Highness.

706
00:42:17,240 --> 00:42:17,720
Everyone out.

707
00:42:19,010 --> 00:42:19,389
Yes.

708
00:42:19,431 --> 00:42:21,181
What exactly happened?

709
00:42:21,290 --> 00:42:21,640
Your Highness.

710
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:23,560
I've got to the bottom of it.

711
00:42:24,040 --> 00:42:24,770
Then say it!

712
00:42:25,080 --> 00:42:27,770
The former palace eunuchs
from the Eastern Palace joined forces

713
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:29,810
to help the deposed Crown Prince escape
to the Jinwu Guard.

714
00:42:30,330 --> 00:42:31,080
The deposed Crown Prince

715
00:42:31,450 --> 00:42:33,720
had put a lot of effort
into the Jinwu Guard's left camp.

716
00:42:34,450 --> 00:42:36,080
And now he's colluded with rebels there,

717
00:42:36,490 --> 00:42:37,240
left the capital overnight,

718
00:42:37,600 --> 00:42:38,200
and headed south.

719
00:42:41,410 --> 00:42:42,640
He ran?

720
00:42:46,200 --> 00:42:47,490
Good!

721
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,970
I thought he was planning something.

722
00:42:53,160 --> 00:42:56,120
That guy always looked down on me.

723
00:42:56,720 --> 00:42:57,789
Three years in prison

724
00:42:57,831 --> 00:42:59,701
must have scared him out of his wits.

725
00:42:59,970 --> 00:43:01,080
All he wants is to save his own skin.

726
00:43:02,810 --> 00:43:05,930
Turns out he's nothing but a coward.

727
00:43:08,640 --> 00:43:11,770
You always say
you've got everything handled.

728
00:43:12,810 --> 00:43:14,450
Something this serious happened,

729
00:43:14,970 --> 00:43:16,410
and you knew nothing about it?

730
00:43:21,080 --> 00:43:21,970
Once I...

731
00:43:22,490 --> 00:43:22,810
Wait!

732
00:43:24,850 --> 00:43:25,370
The first thing

733
00:43:26,330 --> 00:43:27,330
I'll do

734
00:43:28,040 --> 00:43:29,490
after taking the throne

735
00:43:30,080 --> 00:43:31,890
is hunt down that traitor,

736
00:43:32,200 --> 00:43:32,770
Mu Xun!

737
00:43:33,450 --> 00:43:35,040
Report!

738
00:43:35,850 --> 00:43:36,200
Your Highness!

739
00:43:36,330 --> 00:43:37,080
What now?

740
00:43:37,810 --> 00:43:38,770
(Universe in Harmony)
The capital garrison reports

741
00:43:39,040 --> 00:43:40,240
that the deposed Crown Prince has left
the capital with his troops.

742
00:43:40,330 --> 00:43:42,720
He's joined forces with the rebel armies
from Handong and Hanbei!

743
00:43:43,290 --> 00:43:44,240
Now he's turned west.

744
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:46,970
He may be planning to take
the Tongguan route back to Sheng'an!

745
00:43:48,450 --> 00:43:49,490
He's coming back?

746
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:50,810
What should we do?

747
00:43:51,080 --> 00:43:51,850
Your orders, please!

748
00:43:57,290 --> 00:43:57,720
What's the panic?

749
00:43:58,200 --> 00:43:58,560
Get out!

750
00:43:59,240 --> 00:43:59,560
Yes!

751
00:44:02,330 --> 00:44:02,810
Mr. Liu.

752
00:44:04,040 --> 00:44:05,200
You have to save me.

753
00:44:06,120 --> 00:44:06,770
He's coming back...

754
00:44:07,450 --> 00:44:08,909
He's coming back to take my throne!

755
00:44:08,951 --> 00:44:10,951
He... he's going to kill me!

756
00:44:13,930 --> 00:44:14,330
Alright.

757
00:44:15,240 --> 00:44:15,890
I won't take

758
00:44:16,450 --> 00:44:17,330
the throne.

759
00:44:17,890 --> 00:44:18,520
I'll... I'll...

760
00:44:18,640 --> 00:44:20,600
I'll just give it back to him!

761
00:44:30,970 --> 00:44:31,450
Your Highness.

762
00:44:33,810 --> 00:44:34,930
At this point,

763
00:44:36,640 --> 00:44:37,890
you have no choice.

764
00:44:39,720 --> 00:44:41,330
You're going to be the Emperor

765
00:44:42,410 --> 00:44:43,160
whether you like it

766
00:44:43,930 --> 00:44:44,970
or not.

767
00:44:45,890 --> 00:44:46,970
If you ascend the throne first,

768
00:44:47,640 --> 00:44:48,770
he'll be a traitor.

769
00:44:49,520 --> 00:44:50,930
But if the Eastern Palace is restored,

770
00:44:52,080 --> 00:44:53,330
you'll be the traitor.

771
00:44:54,720 --> 00:44:55,450
Between you and him,

772
00:44:56,640 --> 00:44:57,520
only one gets to survive!

773
00:44:59,010 --> 00:44:59,520
Understand?

774
00:45:02,970 --> 00:45:04,160
The coronation will be tomorrow.

775
00:45:04,850 --> 00:45:05,450
Keep it simple.

776
00:45:08,490 --> 00:45:09,200
By order of the Crown Prince,

777
00:45:09,600 --> 00:45:11,970
the Shence Army shall assemble at once
and march to Tongguan

778
00:45:12,520 --> 00:45:13,490
to crush the rebels!

779
00:45:14,640 --> 00:45:15,770
The deposed Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

780
00:45:16,410 --> 00:45:17,520
is ruthless

781
00:45:17,850 --> 00:45:18,640
and seeks to destroy the realm.

782
00:45:19,200 --> 00:45:20,240
His head must be hung
at the palace gates

783
00:45:20,890 --> 00:45:21,970
to uphold the law!

784
00:45:24,780 --> 00:45:28,820
(Next Episode Preview)

785
00:45:29,200 --> 00:45:30,240
I urge Your Majesty

786
00:45:30,810 --> 00:45:34,040
and the Retired Emperor
to go south at once.

787
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:34,680
I,

788
00:45:35,520 --> 00:45:36,930
Yan Shang, Magistrate of Lanyang,

789
00:45:38,370 --> 00:45:40,200
volunteer to defend Sheng'an.

790
00:45:45,681 --> 00:45:48,974
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

791
00:45:51,659 --> 00:45:56,575
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

792
00:45:58,769 --> 00:46:04,614
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

793
00:46:05,114 --> 00:46:10,340
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

794
00:46:13,109 --> 00:46:17,900
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

795
00:46:18,736 --> 00:46:24,815
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

796
00:46:26,616 --> 00:46:29,766
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

797
00:46:29,766 --> 00:46:31,414
♪Burning bright as a song♪

798
00:46:31,466 --> 00:46:35,190
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

799
00:46:35,568 --> 00:46:40,234
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

800
00:46:40,853 --> 00:46:44,894
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

801
00:46:45,385 --> 00:46:47,500
♪Not a single hour less♪

802
00:46:47,540 --> 00:46:54,486
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

803
00:46:55,249 --> 00:46:58,702
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

804
00:46:58,882 --> 00:47:02,027
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

805
00:47:02,466 --> 00:47:09,103
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

806
00:47:09,500 --> 00:47:11,538
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

807
00:47:11,538 --> 00:47:14,014
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

808
00:47:14,052 --> 00:47:16,521
♪You're the only one I need♪

809
00:47:16,725 --> 00:47:23,612
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

810
00:47:23,924 --> 00:47:27,195
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

811
00:47:27,500 --> 00:47:30,673
♪My last untouched innocence♪

812
00:47:30,997 --> 00:47:34,423
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

813
00:47:34,656 --> 00:47:37,881
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

814
00:47:38,212 --> 00:47:45,008
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

815
00:47:45,377 --> 00:47:47,439
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

816
00:47:47,440 --> 00:47:49,943
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

817
00:47:49,990 --> 00:47:52,328
♪You're the only one I need♪

818
00:47:52,559 --> 00:47:59,394
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

819
00:47:59,743 --> 00:48:01,361
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

820
00:48:01,491 --> 00:48:03,287
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

821
00:48:03,644 --> 00:48:06,661
♪You're the only one I need♪

822
00:48:06,701 --> 00:48:08,028
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

